---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { minimumTerms } from '../data/prices';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms that apply when you use the Braven Digital website."
  href="/terms/"
  updated="[DATE]"
>
  <p>
    These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of {site.url.replace('https://', '')} (the "Site"), operated by
    {' '}{site.legalName} ("we", "us"). By using the Site you agree to these Terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the Site</h2>
  <p>You agree to use the Site only for lawful purposes and not to interfere with its operation, attempt to gain unauthorized access, or send spam through our forms.</p>

  <h2>Information on the Site</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep information on the Site accurate, including prices. Prices shown are starting prices and may change
    without notice. The final price, scope and timeline for any project are confirmed in a written proposal or
    agreement, which takes precedence over the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>Services</h2>
  <p>
    Our services are provided under a separate written agreement. Minimum terms (for example, {minimumTerms.localSeo} months for local SEO
    plans and {minimumTerms.social} months for social media plans), payment terms and cancellation terms are described in that agreement.
  </p>

  <h2>Results</h2>
  <p>
    Search rankings, traffic and social media performance depend on factors outside our control, including search
    engine and platform algorithms. We do not guarantee specific rankings or results.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The content, design, logo and code of the Site belong to {site.legalName} unless stated otherwise. You may not copy
    or reuse them without permission. Ownership of work we create for clients is defined in each client agreement.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links and tools</h2>
  <p>The Site may link to or embed third-party services (such as a booking calendar). We are not responsible for their content or practices.</p>

  <h2>Disclaimer and limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    The Site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not
    liable for any indirect, incidental or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of {site.address.regionName}, without regard to conflict-of-law rules.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update these Terms at any time. Continued use of the Site means you accept the updated Terms.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these Terms? Email {site.email}.</p>
</LegalLayout>
